The icon (assets/komorebi.ico) and the seal mark
(crates/komorebi-gpui/assets/brand/seal.svg) were made for Komorebi and are
under the same license as the code (GPL-3.0-or-later).

No fonts are bundled; the interface uses the fonts installed with Windows.
The only third-party assets are the Lucide and Fluent System Icons above
(komorebi.exe only). The third-party sources vendored in third_party/ keep their own
licence files.
